flowchart TB
accTitle: Deployment control and runtime credential access
accDescr: CodeDeploy controls agents on both target types. Each target has its own temporary identity for retrieving the encrypted parameter over TLS.
 CD[CodeDeploy service role] -->|orchestrate| ECA[CodeDeploy agent on EC2]
 CD -->|orchestrate| OPA[CodeDeploy agent on premises]
 ECID[EC2 instance-profile credentials] --> ECA
 OPID[Refreshed STS role-session credentials] --> OPA
 ECA -->|deploy code| ECR[EC2 application]
 OPA -->|deploy code| OPR[On-premises application]
 ECR -->|authorized GetParameter over TLS| SSM[Parameter Store SecureString]
 OPR -->|authorized GetParameter over TLS| SSM
 SSM <-->|KMS decrypt authorization| KMS[KMS key]
class ECID,OPID inputData
class SSM storage
class ECR,OPR output
